WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Choose a scenario and fictional business. Open Dev Tools > Sandbox scenarios. All records in this video belong to demo.amlok.io.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Test different expected outcomes. Choose within-policy, outside-policy or review cases. The institution makes the final lending decision.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Keep webhook delivery off for this example. Events are recorded. The demonstration site suppresses outbound webhook delivery.

4
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Run the scenario. The run moves from queued to running and then completed. Waiting time is shortened in this video.

5
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Follow the checks as processing progresses. Assertions verify the expected outcome. New records are created for each run.

6
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Confirm the completed result. This run completed within policy, with an active monitor and a completed JSON export.

7
00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Keep the generated identifiers. Use these IDs to find the borrower, connections, documents, risk package and other records.

8
00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Inspect requests and responses. Expand a step to see its HTTP status, request ID and recorded payloads.

9
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:51.000
Read the generated risk package. The response includes scope and source context. Use Data Lookup for field definitions.

10
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:57.000
Return to Run history. Open a completed run again to inspect its checks and records. Repeating creates fresh records.

11
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.000
Use the Developer guide. Follow the same journey from your application. Use api.amlok.io with your own workspace Sandbox key.
